{%- comment -%}
  R2-04 cart threshold line (drawer + page). Plain text: no progress bar, no animation, no timer.
    0 < subtotal < $60  ->  "Free US shipping over $60. You're $<60 − subtotal> away."
    subtotal >= $60     ->  "Your order ships free."
  Rendered inside each surface's re-rendered region, so it follows every cart change.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign sayoji_threshold = 6000
  assign sayoji_subtotal = cart.items_subtotal_price
-%}
{%- if sayoji_subtotal >= sayoji_threshold -%}
  <p class="sayoji-threshold" data-sayoji-threshold>Your order ships free.</p>
{%- elsif sayoji_subtotal > 0 -%}
  {%- assign sayoji_remaining = sayoji_threshold | minus: sayoji_subtotal -%}
  <p class="sayoji-threshold" data-sayoji-threshold>Free US shipping over $60. You're {{ sayoji_remaining | money_without_currency | prepend: '$' }} away.</p>
{%- endif -%}
